>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `BESTSIMP_TAC`

``` hol4
clasimpLib.BESTSIMP_TAC : thm list -> tactic
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Solves a goal by best-first classical search with simplification.

`BESTSIMP_TAC thms` runs the classical best-first driver with
assumption-aware full simplification from the current clasimpset installed
as an unsafe wrapper on the current claset. Frontier priority is normalized
goal size, and `clasetSearch.node_limit` bounds expanded states.

Unmarked theorems are inserted as assumptions. Explicit classical markers,
`Simp`, `Iff`, and generic simplifier controls configure only this call.

### Failure

Fails unless search closes the goal before frontier exhaustion or the node
limit.

### Example

``` hol4
Theorem bestsimp_tac_example:
  (p /\ q) ==> q /\ p
Proof
  clasimpLib.BESTSIMP_TAC []
QED
```

